{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobSeViNo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob7Ti8ai.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobenvYaL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobcKR4kq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46のメンバーとして公開されてから４年が経ちました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に、あっという間に感じます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "立ち止まりそうになった時も、\n横を見れば同期がいてどんな時でも背中を見せ続けてくださる先輩がいて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は、守りたくなる愛おしい後輩も出来ました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度思い返しても夢なんじゃないかと感じるほど素敵な景色を見させてくれてありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルでいさせてくれてありがとう☺️\n応援してくれるみなさんが支えです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな時も味方でいてくれてありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "５年目、どんなことが待っていても大丈夫！\n乃木坂が好きな気持ちが1番大切だと思っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただいまって今年もいろんな場所で言いたいなぁ\nでも、このメンバーで初めての場所にも行きたいです\n乃木坂46という名前を刻みたい！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなで、素敵な景色沢山見ようね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今までもこれからも！\n乃木坂がだいすき！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46でいれて、\nそして何より5期生として活動できていることが私の人生の誇りです！！💜5️⃣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "５年目も駆け抜けるよー！！\nついてきてね！みんな！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは、二つのライブがありますね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃木坂46  Coupling Collection 2022-2025"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃⽊坂46 5th ALBUM MEMORIAL LIVE 『My respect』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆様を楽しませられるように準備頑張ってますよ〜🔥\nどちらも配信も決まっています！\n乃木坂の楽曲聴いて、楽しみに待っててね〜🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では！\nまた書きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobt16YJJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.2.4"}], "source": "official"}